{"title":"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, two 8 by 10 rectangles overlap to form a 4 by 4 square. What is the total area of the shaded region?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the rectangles didn't overlap, there would be a combined area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed854f22b366a3fee26698023b088519d0c06f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 10 \\times 2 = 80 \\times 2 = 160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"15\" />. However, since there is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> overlap, the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9ff31e339d09ea9eb7af9cb2b01d06f7946b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4 \\times 2 = 16 \\times 2 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" /> less than this, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8c1a72d1fb054ad3e396f7dc5941a752c02ef1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$160 - 32 = \\boxed{128}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"132\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC\" title=\"2020 CIMC\">2020 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062916\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1699/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion dept